WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.675
Paste your finished plan below.

2
00:00:01.675 --> 00:00:04.095
Then fill in the box that matters most: what

3
00:00:04.095 --> 00:00:06.430
did you change, what did you keep, and why.

4
00:00:07.060 --> 00:00:09.030
That one line is the proof that the plan

5
00:00:09.030 --> 00:00:09.720
is yours —

6
00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:12.410
the A I drafted it, but you decided.
